            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "The account was refused before the handler ran: the company is suspended, or it is read-only and this is a write. Every path under `/api` answers this.\n\nA permission denial can also answer 403, and it carries **no body** — a refusal that described itself would confirm the resource exists, which is what the disclosure rule is protecting."
